##* {{quote-book|en|year=1889|year_published=1899|author={{w|Rudyard Kipling}}|title={{w|Under the Deodars}}|chapter=A Wayside Comedy|location=Boston|publisher=The Greenock Press|page=60|text=When a man is absolutely alone in a '''Station''' he runs a certain risk of falling into evil ways.}}
